WEBVTT

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:23.530
The number you have dialed is currently unavailable...

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.780
Good morning.

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:46.660
Suzume-san, did you receive a phone call from Torako-san late last night?

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:56.360
No Battery

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:00.040
I guess fell asleep a little early last night.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.530
Calls
Kageyama-san

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.390
I wonder what it was?

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:14.110
What's with you two?

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.520
You look super tired.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:18.700
Well...

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.510
Don't "well" me!

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:26.220
Torako here just showed up at my house all of a sudden last night.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.100
She was all like "let me stay over tonight."

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.310
So, she stayed over...

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:43.750
...but we ended up playing fighting games.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.870
What is this?

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:47.200
A sleepover?!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:51.200
How could you do something so enjoyable without me!?

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.490
Without me?  Without me?

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:54.740
Why!

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.400
Y-Y-You took a bath together too, didn't you?

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.410
Shut up!

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:02.370
D-Did you sleep together in the same bed?

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:03.010
Are you dense?!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.850
You think we actually slept?!

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.010
Sleepover...

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:09.730
Did something happen at your house?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.810
No, nothing really.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.960
Torako, where were you yesterday?

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.920
Staying overnight somewhere without permission...

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.250
Doing something like that...

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.430
So, where was it?

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.140
Suzume's place?

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:49.980
N-No...

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:53.020
If you're going to stay over somewhere then at least notify us!

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.990
We won't know if you don't tell us!

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.870
I'm sorry...

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:03.610
Who is that?

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.790
Why are you always like this?

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.870
It's the same thing with you, again and again...

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.030
That's Kageyama-kun's older sister.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:11.110
How long do you plan on repeating this?

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.130
Oh, is that so?

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.870
You're always doing whatever you feel like...

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:24.630
What a shock to find she has an older sister.

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:27.930
I wonder how many more siblings she has around?

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.960
Yeah... She doesn't look anything like her.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.880
No, she doesn't does she.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.130
I was surprised enough that she had an older brother.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:37.840
Yeah...

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.970
Hey, get off!

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:43.480
So, did something happen?

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:48.260
Yes, she got her rights read to her half a dozen times.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.900
Touma...

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:54.710
How do you know Torako-san's sister, Nene-san?

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:58.000
Well, I didn't really <i>know</i>...

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:04.410
I just thought that Student Council President Kageyama had the same last name, so...

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:06.090
Student council president?

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:08.610
Right, student council president.

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:12.760
Since I plan to occupy that seat one day, I...

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.430
Student council president?!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.410
What, you didn't know?

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:18.810
She's the student council president?

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.230
What is she like?

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:26.700
The current president of Kamizono Academy's high school student council, Kageyama Oniyuri!

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:31.630
Clearheaded, a master of martial arts, a beautiful figure, fair and honorable...

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:34.270
A triple, no, quadruple threat!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:37.450
She's like a shining example of the perfect student!

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.480
I can't believe that Torako-san has such a perfect sister.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:44.190
But, are they really related?

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:47.410
Wait, that's really rude to Torako-san!

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.970
Are they really related by blood, I wonder?

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:52.690
I said, get off me!

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:54.930
I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.600
Just let me stay at your house tonight, Touma...

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.700
Say what?

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:02.420
Torako-san can't stand to face her sister.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.070
Don't follow me!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.410
You're so annoying!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.830
Please, anything...

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.080
Oh, Student Council President!

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.350
So this is she?

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.920
I will be escorting you home today.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.860
Ain't that nice, Torako?

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:40.990
I don't wanna!

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:41.880
Come here!

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.720
Let me go, you kidnapper!

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:45.750
We haven't finished our conversation from this morning.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.200
I have nothing to speak to you about!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.200
Kitsune-senpai.

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:50.960
What, what?

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:52.570
Is something the matter?

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:55.720
Is something up?

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.480
Who is that?

00:07:58.130 --> 00:07:59.970
That's Tora-chan's big brother.

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.370
Big brother!

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.250
Her older brother.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.160
That's me!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.090
Someone's making a ruckus over here.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:09.250
Oh, it's that guy!

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:12.560
What?

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:13.780
I just remembered!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:16.220
That person is the skirt flipper!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:19.210
What are you saying?

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:21.770
Don't go shoutin' that around, four-eyes!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:25.960
She called ya a skirt flipper 'cause that's what you did.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:28.140
Oh yeah?  And who asked you, yankee?

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.900
Nobody gives a crap what you think.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.550
What was that?

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.740
E-Excuse me, Kitsune-san!

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:37.620
Um, Torako-san is...

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.620
Torako, we're going home!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.570
I don't wanna!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:45.720
Don't worry, she's not angry.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:49.680
She's just overprotective of Torako.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:53.310
I'll go home, sure, but not with you!

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:53.310
Is that so?

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:54.990
Dunno.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.720
Stop being so selfish!

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.940
I can go home by myself!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:09:01.470
In other words... she's worried about her.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:01.470
You say that, but will you really go home?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.060
She's really cold to me, though.

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:04.060
What, you don't believe me?

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:07.480
I said I'll go home myself, so leave me alone!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.000
Torako!

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.730
Sisters, huh?

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.980
I don't wanna!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.490
Torako!  Come home and apologize to Dad!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.660
No way!  I didn't do anything wrong!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.370
But you ran away from home!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.030
How many times is this now?

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:22.170
Ran away?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.290
Shut up!  Shut up!  Shut up!  Shut up!  Shut up!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.520
Do you have any idea how worried our parents were?

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:31.880
Like hell they are!  They're not my parents!

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:50.230
Take that back.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.190
No...

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:01.320
Onee-chan, you dummy!  I hope you go bald!

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:02.900
Torako-san!

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.070
Um, Ms. President...

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:11.040
I apologize for that.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:13.150
Please be careful on your way home, everyone.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.770
Yes, but that is not the issue...

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:19.810
What just happened?

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:20.970
Man...

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:40.360
The high school kids are already heading home.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.670
Looks like it.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:44.890
Yagi-chan, you said you have an older brother in the high school, didn't you?

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:46.250
I did.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.000
You don't go home together?

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:49.960
Of course not.

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.820
Something the matter with that?

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:52.900
Not really.

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.230
But, why not?

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:56.920
I just don't have any reason to.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.390
We'll both be at home together anyway, won't we?

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:02.340
It's a pain for both of us if we're early or late.

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:07.680
I wish I had siblings.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.180
An older sister would be nice.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.080
And why are you about to cry?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.560
But... It's just...

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:43.260
It's a family matter.  We just happen to be in the same class.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.470
We shouldn't butt in.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:48.140
But she's our friend, and in the same class!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.100
Is there something we could do?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:56.680
At times like this, just hug her tightly and...

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:58.570
Hug her, and what?

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:05.220
That's it.  Even I can tell when it's not funny anymore.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:28.090
Yeah, well, to put it bluntly...

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:34.890
Torako has a different mother from us.

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:02.050
Um, we did not mean to pry...

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:27.660
Suzume?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:54.560
Torako lived alone with her real mother until the middle of elementary school.

00:13:55.440 --> 00:14:00.430
When later it was decided that she'd live with us, the quarreling began.

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:06.520
Dad had just suddenly gone and picked up Torako, and Mom flew into a fit of rage.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:09.490
Torako really didn't take to that.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:19.410
W-Wait!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.380
What happened to Torako-chan's mother?

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.880
She's gone.

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:29.980
Dead.  Heard it was some illness.

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:35.220
Sit down.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.100
What's your name?

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:42.940
Torako.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.610
Then you'll be Kageyama Torako, starting today.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:49.530
That's a nice, strong sounding name.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.490
Sit.

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:56.450
I'm fine.

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:58.950
Oh?

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.170
I'll be your sister, starting today.

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:07.490
Onee-chan?

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.250
I'm Oniyuri.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.090
What?

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.430
That's my name.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:14.140
Oniyuri...

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:17.930
Note:  Oniyuri means "Tiger Lily" but the literal meaning of the kanji is "Collection of 100 Demons"

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:18.230
That sounds even stronger...

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:26.080
Touma...

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:28.280
Console me.

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:37.960
Are you dense?

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.370
Ew.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.840
Everything's just really screwed up for me...

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:44.170
How embarrassing...

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:46.340
Did Ayu and the others say anything to you?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:52.280
I have an older sister...

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.630
And we fight a lot too...

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.560
W-What?

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:02.390
You actually consoled me, Touma?

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:03.890
N-No!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:06.810
T-Thanks.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.580
I said I didn't!

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:25.460
Yes.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.480
I have to apologize to her.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.470
I wish I hasn't heard that.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.800
Nothing to do about it now.

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.180
We heard, and that is that.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:44.180
Speaking of which, her, on the other hand...

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:49.010
Torako doesn't open up to either Dad or Mom.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:52.230
When they get in some fight, she's always running away from home.

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:53.570
Taking Suzume with her...

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:57.780
I guess this is the first time since she started high school.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:03.500
I got a phone call last night from Torako-san.

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:10.460
But I was in the bath at the time and I didn't notice it for quite a while.

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:15.670
Well then, Ayumi.  Call Torako-san on your cell phone.

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:19.960
We shall go home together!

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:22.850
Tatsuki-san!  Sure!

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.850
Perhaps she is still in the school.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:32.230
The reason Torako hasn't run away from home for real is because of her sister.

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:37.280
For some reason, she's cared a lot for Torako since she was little.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:41.880
But, it's obvious Torako's not any good at being cared for.

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:17.440
Did it hurt?

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:20.660
Yeah...

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.580
I see.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:24.740
I'm sorry.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.080
I'm sorry, too!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.430
Ayu, Ta-chan!

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.860
So we're not going home together?

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:01.240
Get going.

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:04.620
What?

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:08.920
What was that?

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:11.870
Suzu?

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:18.760
What?

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.040
Kageyama-kun!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.640
Hey, wanna go to karaoke?

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:58.880
Fight!

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:03.250
Kitsune punch!  Kitsune punch!  Kitsune punch!

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:04.160
Kitsune kick!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.600
No fair!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.350
Take that!  Take that!  Take that!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.510
Yeah!  All right!  I win!

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:12.260
No fair!

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:13.520
One more time!

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.020
Let's go, Torako.

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:24.450
Here.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:30.280
Yesterday, the old man that lives here accused Oniyuri of being a "persimmon thief."

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:37.970
She was proved innocent, but the old man wasn't punished.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:39.590
What do you think?

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:43.300
Let's get 'im back, Torako!

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:47.260
Finished.

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:57.400
You like persimmons that much, huh?

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.800
Then eat some of this!

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:01.900
You smelly old man!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:12.040
We were just teaching that old man a lesson.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:13.420
Are you two idiots?

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:15.820
You didn't do anything bad, right, Onee-chan?

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:17.080
So we got him back.

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:22.650
I sympathize with your feelings, but this isn't the way to make things right.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:26.900
Okay, let's go apologize.

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:23.010
So, what's on Hyakko next week?

00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:24.670
"Four People Form a Tiger."

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:26.500
Huh?  It's the final episode?

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:28.540
But I hear it's a story about the entrance ceremony.

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:30.300
Oh, so it's time for that.

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:30.790
For what?

00:23:30.790 --> 00:23:32.180
This story.

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:33.450
Tune in next time!
